      "updated": 1790334307870,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  - receive input from stdin, HTTP, Slack, etc.;\n  - normalize it into an internal InteractionRequest;\n  - carry channel metadata such as user ID, conversation/session ID, and reply target;\n  - format a RunResult into a channel-specific response;\n  - handle channel lifecycle concerns such as EOF, disconnects, and streaming.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "  - receive input from stdin, HTTP, Slack, etc.;\n  - normalize it into an internal InteractionRequest;\n  - carry channel metadata such as user ID, conversation/session ID, and reply target;\n  - format a RunResult into a channel-specific response;\n  - handle channel lifecycle concerns such as EOF, disconnects, and streaming.",
