      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ADR: sessions management.\nSessions belong to Agent domain, from local client(cli), SessionRepository methods (create_session, get_sesions...)\ntake no user argument, while it does from api interface, so we define ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ADR: sessions management.\nSessions belong to Agent domain, from local client(cli), SessionRepository methods (create_session, get_sesions...) take no user argument, while it does from api interface, so we define ",
